    {
      "s": 5.07,
      "e": 7.07,
      "text": "So on that side you can grab the..."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.16,
      "e": 16.64,
      "text": "So this soil seems kind of sandy so"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.48,
      "e": 20.48,
      "text": "It'll be a good experiment to see how well it will hold."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.48,
      "e": 32.74,
      "text": "Another guy?"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.74,
      "e": 37.74,
      "text": "Sure, quick."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.74,
      "e": 40.74,
      "text": "So that's two guys, but just one and we can't pull it out."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.74,
      "e": 45.38,
      "text": "And some of that movement is probably the duckbill coming up into that perpendicular."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.38,
      "e": 47.38,
      "text": "But let's get three guys on."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.38,
      "e": 56.84,
      "text": "Somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.84,
      "e": 57.84,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.84,
      "e": 72.81,
      "text": "We're gonna do a figure eight on a bite."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.81,
      "e": 76.66,
      "text": "So you have a loop?"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.66,
      "e": 77.66,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "s": 77.66,
      "e": 81.66,
      "text": "And then you can use one of your carabiners and attach it to your skedco."
    },
    {
      "s": 81.66,
      "e": 85.66,
      "text": "And this will be your weighted line."
    },
    {
      "s": 85.66,
      "e": 90.66,
      "text": "But what happens is this is self-mining so you don't even really need to do anything there."
    },
    {
      "s": 90.66,
      "e": 92.66,
      "text": "You can get all the way up to here."
    },
    {
      "s": 92.66,
      "e": 94.66,
      "text": "And then what do you do?"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.66,
      "e": 96.66,
      "text": "Pull."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.66,
      "e": 107.46,
      "text": "So every time you have something like this though it introduces resistance, right?"
    },
    {
      "s": 107.46,
